Write readable Python source only, under60lines. Script runs actual frozen executable release-candidate/PlasmidAssistant/PlasmidAssistant.exe relative to Path(__file__).resolve().parent. Load local_features.json entries, choose Path(entries[0]['source']) input .dna, hash bytes before. Bio.SeqIO.read source snapgene. tempfile.TemporaryDirectory directory with spaces prefix. subprocess.run exe --cli source --output temp/result.dna --include-unknown-orfs, check=True timeout180. Parse output snapgene. Assert sequence unchanged, feature count>=original. Assert each oldfeature (type,str(location),qualifiers) equal corresponding output prefix feature. Assert source sha256 unchanged. Print JSON with real featurecounts and native true, limitation 'Same-machine smoke check only'. No mocks, no deleting user files, no tests claiming biological accuracy. Use correct Python imports. Return source only.
